The point being that supra-genius monsters should not be walking up to
you, engaging you in melee, and pulling your brain out through your
skull.  They should be devising cunning strategems whereby you become
their helpless captive through fearsome traps, and *then* pulling your
brain out through your skull.  Not, note, through your nose.  Their
tentacles *burrow* into your head to extract your brain; that's why it
takes so long.  Removing a brain Egyptian-style is probably much faster.
